>; <em>Hill </em>v. <em>Merchants\u2019 Ins. Co., </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"92751\"><a href=\"/opinion/92751/hill-v-merchants-mutual-insurance/#527\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hill v. Merchants&#x27; Mutual Insurance\">134 U. S. 515, 527</a></span>; <em>Sturges </em>v. <em>Crowninshield, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"85267\"><a href=\"/opinion/85267/bank-of-columbia-v-okely/#200\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Bank of Columbia v. Okely\">4 Wheat. 122, 200</a></span>. (2) <em>Columbus &amp; Greenville Ry. </em>v. <em>Miller, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"101706\"><a href=\"/opinion/101706/columbus-greenville-r-co-v-miller-ex-rel-mississippi-levee-dist/#99\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Columbus &amp; Greenville R. Co. v. Miller Ex Rel....\">283 U. S. 96, 99-100</a></span>; <em>Hooker </em>v. <em>Burr, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"96103\"><a href=\"/opinion/96103/hooker-v-burr/#418\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Hooker v. Burr\">194 U. S. 415, 418-419</a></span>; <em>Williams </em>v. <em>Eggleston, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"94864\"><a href=\"/opinion/94864/williams-v-eggleston/#309\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Williams v. Eggleston\">170 U. S. 304, 309</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}